  "translation": "Kɔlɔn min kɔnɔ Yishmaeli (Ismayɛla) binna ayen ⟨את⟩ mɔgɔw ka sɔgɔw bɛɛ, minnu o ye tubu Gedalaya (Gedali) bolo — o de ye kɔlɔn ye min Masakɛ Asa ye a dilan Baasha, Israyɛl masakɛ, ɲɛ na; Yishmaeli, Netanya denkɛ, ye ⟨אתו⟩ tiɲɛ sɔgɔw ye.",
